# Public emergency intake — system context (ADR-038/040/041/043)
# careOS — docs/diagrams/emergency-intake-context.mmd

flowchart LR
  A[Anonymous caller<br/>no tenant scope] -->|POST /public/emergency/requests| P[PublicEmergencyController]

  P -->|"slug -> PUBLISHED only"| D[(public_facility_listings<br/>projection, ADR-038)]
  P -->|normalized phone dedupe<br/>(EMERGENCY_DEDUPE_SECONDS)| Rq[(emergency_requests<br/>tenant RLS)]
  P -->|caller PII AES-256-GCM<br/>token = SHA-256 hash| Enc[FieldEncryption<br/>ADR-041]

  Rq -->|outbox event| O[(outbox_events)]
  Rq -->|delayed job level 1| Q[(BullMQ<br/>emergency-escalation queue)]
  Q -->|escalate job| W[EmergencyIntakeWorker]
  W -->|guarded updateMany<br/>exactly-once| Rq

  S[Staff / emergency board] -->|GET /emergency/requests/stream| SSE[SSE on<br/>emergency-requests topic]
  Rq -->|Emergency.RequestRetained etc.| Realtime[(Redis pub/sub)]
  Realtime --> SSE

  W -->|repeat maintenance job<br/>(NODE_ENV != test)| MT[reconcileEscalations + applyRetention]
  MT -->|re-promote overdue<br/>lost SLA jobs| Q
  MT -->|retain PII after<br/>EMERGENCY_RETENTION_DAYS| Rq